<title>MEXICO: SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT CANADA 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT CANADA 4-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico beat Canada 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a CONCACAF World Cup qualifying match on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Carlos Hermosillo (50 and 80), Benjamin Galindo</p>
<p>(59, penalty), Zague (87)</p>
<p>Attendance: 100,000</p>
</text>
